1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,880
 This is where the plan has been leading.

2
00:00:02,880 --> 00:00:06,240
 Glass runs from floor to ceiling on the garden side,

3
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:09,480
 with the pool lying just beyond the threshold.

4
00:00:09,480 --> 00:00:13,320
 How much sun comes in depends on which way the plot faces,

5
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:15,320
 which we do not yet know.

6
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:17,760
 We have assumed this side looks north,

7
00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:20,600
 where the room is lit mostly by the open sky,

8
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:22,800
 rather than by direct sun.

9
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:25,600
 The sun panel lets you try the other directions.

